    "answer": {
      "short": "$3(x-3)^2-19$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3x^2-18x+8&=3\\left(x^2-6x+\\frac83\\right)\\\\3x^2-18x+8&=3\\left((x-3)^2-9+\\frac83\\right)\\\\3x^2-18x+8&=3(x-3)^2-19.\\end{align*}$$",
